      "id": "t43_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -304
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Game of Life\n\n`spread/gol-step` advances a 2-D boolean grid (32 × 32) by one Conway tick.\n\nHere the grid is read from state, stepped and written back every frame. The first frame starts from a random soup (about a third of the cells alive, seeded per cell). Watch the colony evolve.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Game of Life\n\n`spread/gol-step` advances a 2-D boolean grid (32 × 32) by one Conway tick.\n\nHere the grid is read from state, stepped and written back every frame. The first frame starts from a random soup (about a third of the cells alive, seeded per cell). Watch the colony evolve.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 240
      }
    },
